    "description": "Zeetok helps you meet new friends from all over the world. You can meet friends who shares the same interests with you and want to chat now! It\u2019s fun, friendly, and free!\r\n\u2022 10+ million users worldwide\r\n\u2022 200 Thousand matches daily\r\n\r\nFeature Highlights\r\n*Chat\r\nChat on Zeetok to meet and get to know your new friends . Within Zeetok , you can send text or voice messages . Start chatting with online real people around you now!\r\n*Express Yourself\r\nUse your profile to express yourself and make a great first impression.More than 90% of the users have passed the photo verification. We are committed to creating a more authentic platform for making friends.\r\n*Share daily life\r\nYou can post some interest and beautiful moment in your daily life and share with others on Zeetok so that you can learn more about each other.\r\n*Connect with more firend\r\nYou will Connect with many friends with the same interests here.Swipe right to like, and swipe left to ignore.\r\n*Recommend new friends for you\r\nAdd Zeetok as a widget on your Home Screen, here shows photos for new friends nearby. You can see the people that Connected with you, maybe you have the same hobbies and like the same type songs, and then click it to open the app to chat with them and become friends. It\u2019s fun and surprised!\r\n\r\n\r\nYou're in good hands\r\nZeetok is a platform that consistently ensures safety and respect within our community. \r\n\u25b7 We do not tolerate any kind of inappropriate behavior and have strict usage guidelines to ensure that you have the best user experience with us.\r\n\u25b7 All personal information is securely stored and not sold nor shared with third parties.\r\n\r\n\r\nGET MORE WITH ZEETOK PREMIUM:\r\n\u2013 Extended filters. Find someone who meets all your criteria.\r\n\u2013 Special gifts. Give gifts to someone you like.\r\n\u2013 Video HD quality. Show your beauty/handsomeness clearly!\r\nYour personal data is securely 